              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 29,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "\"aircraft\" and \"ship\" shall have the meanings respectively assigned to them in Schedule VI (Note 3).] \"(2) The deduction shall be allowed—",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-147-5-c-001",
