              "id": "147-5-b",
              "indent": 0,
              "line_start": 33,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "for ten consecutive tax years out of fifteen years beginning from the relevant tax year, at the option of an assessee, in the case of an entity mentioned in sub-section (1)(b).\" '(5) For the purposes of this section,—",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-147-5-b-001",
                  "target_id": "147-1-b",
                  "target_type": "clause",
